{"id":"ab04e66002371b24","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-ultradistribution.md","title":"Beurling and Roumieu Ultradistributions","display":"df-ultradistribution — Beurling and Roumieu Ultradistributions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ultradistribution","aliases":["58-df-ultradistribution"],"display":"df-ultradistribution — Beurling and Roumieu Ultradistributions","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-distribution.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ultradistribution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ultradistribution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ultradistribution — Beurling and Roumieu Ultradistributions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c53fe47de39217ed\" href=\"?note=c53fe47de39217ed\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-distribution.md\">../batch03/58-df-distribution.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-ultradistribution-—-Ultradistribution\">df-ultradistribution — Ultradistribution</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\)</span> (open set), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(M_p)_{p\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\(M=(M_p)_{p\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (weight sequence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathrm{Euc},n}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathrm{Euc},n}\\)</span> (Euclidean topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}\\)</span> (upstream topology predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_n^{(M)}(\\Omega),\\mathcal D_n^{\\{M\\}}(\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathcal D_n^{(M)}(\\Omega),\\mathcal D_n^{\\{M\\}}(\\Omega)\\)</span> (Beurling and Roumieu test-function spaces)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(-)&#39;_b\">\\((-)&#39;_b\\)</span> (continuous dual with its strong topology)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeightSequence}_S,\\mathrm{BeurlingUltradistributionSpace}_S,\\mathrm{RoumieuUltradistributionSpace}_S,\\mathrm{UltradistributionSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{WeightSequence}_S,\\mathrm{BeurlingUltradistributionSpace}_S,\\mathrm{RoumieuUltradistributionSpace}_S,\\mathrm{UltradistributionSpace}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultradistribution} \\vdash \\mathrm{WeightSequence}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow M:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land M_0=1\\land\\forall p\\geq1\\;(M_p^2\\leq M_{p-1}M_{p+1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultradistribution} \\vdash \\mathrm{WeightSequence}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow M:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land M_0=1\\land\\forall p\\geq1\\;(M_p^2\\leq M_{p-1}M_{p+1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultradistribution} \\vdash \\mathcal D_n^{(M)}(\\Omega)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega):\\forall h&gt;0\\;\\sup_{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n,\\ x\\in\\Omega}\\frac{|\\partial^\\alpha\\varphi(x)|}{h^{|\\alpha|}M_{|\\alpha|}}&lt;\\infty\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultradistribution} \\vdash \\mathcal D_n^{(M)}(\\Omega)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega):\\forall h&gt;0\\;\\sup_{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n,\\ x\\in\\Omega}\\frac{|\\partial^\\alpha\\varphi(x)|}{h^{|\\alpha|}M_{|\\alpha|}}&lt;\\infty\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultradistribution} \\vdash \\mathcal D_n^{\\{M\\}}(\\Omega)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega):\\exists h&gt;0\\;\\sup_{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n,\\ x\\in\\Omega}\\frac{|\\partial^\\alpha\\varphi(x)|}{h^{|\\alpha|}M_{|\\alpha|}}&lt;\\infty\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultradistribution} \\vdash \\mathcal D_n^{\\{M\\}}(\\Omega)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega):\\exists h&gt;0\\;\\sup_{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n,\\ x\\in\\Omega}\\frac{|\\partial^\\alpha\\varphi(x)|}{h^{|\\alpha|}M_{|\\alpha|}}&lt;\\infty\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultradistribution} \\vdash \\mathrm{BeurlingUltradistributionSpace}_S(U,M,\\Omega,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\\mathrm{WeightSequence}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathrm{Euc},n},\\mathbb R^n)\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_{\\mathrm{Euc},n}\\land U=(\\mathcal D_n^{(M)}(\\Omega))&#39;_b\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultradistribution} \\vdash \\mathrm{BeurlingUltradistributionSpace}_S(U,M,\\Omega,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\\mathrm{WeightSequence}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathrm{Euc},n},\\mathbb R^n)\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_{\\mathrm{Euc},n}\\land U=(\\mathcal D_n^{(M)}(\\Omega))&#39;_b\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultradistribution} \\vdash \\mathrm{RoumieuUltradistributionSpace}_S(U,M,\\Omega,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\\mathrm{WeightSequence}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathrm{Euc},n},\\mathbb R^n)\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_{\\mathrm{Euc},n}\\land U=(\\mathcal D_n^{\\{M\\}}(\\Omega))&#39;_b\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultradistribution} \\vdash \\mathrm{RoumieuUltradistributionSpace}_S(U,M,\\Omega,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\\mathrm{WeightSequence}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathrm{Euc},n},\\mathbb R^n)\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_{\\mathrm{Euc},n}\\land U=(\\mathcal D_n^{\\{M\\}}(\\Omega))&#39;_b\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultradistribution} \\vdash \\mathrm{UltradistributionSpace}_S(U,M,\\Omega,n,\\mathfrak q)\\leftrightarrow \\bigl(\\mathfrak q=\\mathrm B\\land\\mathrm{BeurlingUltradistributionSpace}_S(U,M,\\Omega,n)\\bigr)\\lor\\bigl(\\mathfrak q=\\mathrm R\\land\\mathrm{RoumieuUltradistributionSpace}_S(U,M,\\Omega,n)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultradistribution} \\vdash \\mathrm{UltradistributionSpace}_S(U,M,\\Omega,n,\\mathfrak q)\\leftrightarrow \\bigl(\\mathfrak q=\\mathrm B\\land\\mathrm{BeurlingUltradistributionSpace}_S(U,M,\\Omega,n)\\bigr)\\lor\\bigl(\\mathfrak q=\\mathrm R\\land\\mathrm{RoumieuUltradistributionSpace}_S(U,M,\\Omega,n)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Parentheses mean the universal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>-condition (Beurling); braces mean the existential <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>-condition (Roumieu).</li>\n<li>The ultradistribution space is a continuous dual, not a union of distribution spaces indexed by a real number.</li>\n<li>The ambient dimension is an explicit parameter of both test-function operators and all three space predicates.</li>\n<li>Ultradistributions are used in microlocal analysis.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-ultradistribution-—-Ultradistribution","text":"df-ultradistribution — Ultradistribution","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-distribution.md","status":"resolved","id":"c53fe47de39217ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-distribution.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"M=(M_p)_{p\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathrm{Euc},n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_n^{(M)}(\\Omega),\\mathcal D_n^{\\{M\\}}(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"(-)'_b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeightSequence}_S,\\mathrm{BeurlingUltradistributionSpace}_S,\\mathrm{RoumieuUltradistributionSpace}_S,\\mathrm{UltradistributionSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultradistribution} \\vdash \\mathrm{WeightSequence}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow M:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb R_{>0}\\land M_0=1\\land\\forall p\\geq1\\;(M_p^2\\leq M_{p-1}M_{p+1})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultradistribution} \\vdash \\mathcal D_n^{(M)}(\\Omega)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega):\\forall h>0\\;\\sup_{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n,\\ x\\in\\Omega}\\frac{|\\partial^\\alpha\\varphi(x)|}{h^{|\\alpha|}M_{|\\alpha|}}<\\infty\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultradistribution} \\vdash \\mathcal D_n^{\\{M\\}}(\\Omega)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty(\\Omega):\\exists h>0\\;\\sup_{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^n,\\ x\\in\\Omega}\\frac{|\\partial^\\alpha\\varphi(x)|}{h^{|\\alpha|}M_{|\\alpha|}}<\\infty\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultradistribution} \\vdash \\mathrm{BeurlingUltradistributionSpace}_S(U,M,\\Omega,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\land\\mathrm{WeightSequence}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathrm{Euc},n},\\mathbb R^n)\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_{\\mathrm{Euc},n}\\land U=(\\mathcal D_n^{(M)}(\\Omega))'_b","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultradistribution} \\vdash \\mathrm{RoumieuUltradistributionSpace}_S(U,M,\\Omega,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\land\\mathrm{WeightSequence}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathrm{Euc},n},\\mathbb R^n)\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_{\\mathrm{Euc},n}\\land U=(\\mathcal D_n^{\\{M\\}}(\\Omega))'_b","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultradistribution} \\vdash \\mathrm{UltradistributionSpace}_S(U,M,\\Omega,n,\\mathfrak q)\\leftrightarrow \\bigl(\\mathfrak q=\\mathrm B\\land\\mathrm{BeurlingUltradistributionSpace}_S(U,M,\\Omega,n)\\bigr)\\lor\\bigl(\\mathfrak q=\\mathrm R\\land\\mathrm{RoumieuUltradistributionSpace}_S(U,M,\\Omega,n)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false}],"bytes":2957,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1338","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-ultradistribution.md|58-df-ultradistribution]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["c53fe47de39217ed","e7514bc4cefba4f2"]}